                <p>Founded in 1929 as an educational institution, The Museum of Modern Art is dedicated to being the foremost museum of modern art in the world.</p>
                <a href="/about/index" class="more">ABOUT MoMA&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="arrow">&raquo;</span></a>
              </div>
              <div class="ps1-about-ps1">
                <a href="http://momaps1.org/" class="image"></a>
                <a href="http://momaps1.org/" class="heading">MoMA PS1</a>
                <p>MoMA’s affiliate, a short train ride away in Long Island City, Queens, is one of the world’s largest organizations devoted to contemporary art.</p>
                <a href="http://momaps1.org/about/" class="more">ABOUT MoMA PS1&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="arrow">&raquo;</span></a>
              </div>
